Character Verification Alert
****************************

Hello <%= @user.display_name %>,

We are informing you that your verified character <%= @character.name %> @ <%= @character.home_world %> was claimed by
another user. If this was expected, you may disregard this e-mail.

If this was not expected, this may indicate that your Square Enix account was accessed by someone else. You will need to
reverify your character from the XIVAuth Character Management page (<%= character_registrations_url %>). Additionally,
please consider:

* Changing your Square Enix account password.
* Enabling two-factor authentication on your Square Enix and XIVAuth accounts.
* Changing the passwords on any other sites that reuse your Square Enix password.

If you have any questions about this notification, feel free to reach out via any of the following methods:

* Send an email to xivauth@wolf.dev
* Join the XIVAuth Discord (<%= discord_url %>), and ping @KazWolfe

Thanks,
XIVAuth User Management Service
